Package: reftip
Title: Hover Tooltips for Reference Links in altdoc Sites
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Bjarke", "Hautop", email = "bjarke.hautop@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: altdoc (via Quarto's code-link and the downlit package) already
    turns function names in rendered R code blocks into links to their
    documentation. reftip adds the missing piece: doxygen-style hover
    tooltips on those links, showing the target's signature and a one-line
    summary, embedded at build time from the package's man/*.Rd files so the
    site works fully offline. reftip is a post-processing step run after
    altdoc::render_docs() -- it does not modify altdoc or the linking itself.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    tools,
    fs
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
